In this project, I worked on building a simple calculator program using C++.
* Set up the basic structure for a calculator application.
* Included mathematical functionality using the C++ standard library.
* Implemented arithmetic operation concepts for performing calculations.
* Worked with variables to store input values and results.
* Practiced function usage for executing mathematical operations.
* Displayed calculation results through console output.
* Explored how functions can simplify and organize calculations.
* Tested the program structure for performing basic arithmetic tasks.
This project helped me understand functions, arithmetic operations, variable handling, and the fundamentals of building a calculator application in C++.
